@{FG text}


My hunt for the Amiga hardware

I've done some thinking and tried to sum it up

    A600GS / A1200NG it has advantages but also it's locked down
    and I really don't need legacy ports, you can't even use a
    real Amiga mouse on them.
    
    I've tried rpi5 and the experience was not smooth as rpi4
    
    N100 SBC maybe ? and do my own setup                      
    THE A1200      ? I think this has a big chance to be great
    AmiCube        ?                                          
    Pocketstorm    ?                                          
   
    
I want new Amiga hardware be it emulation/FPGA whatever. . . . .
                                                               .
                                                               .
                                                               .
                                                               .
                                                               .
                                                               .
                                                               .
                                                        /8080 ..




